data: {"type":"TOOL_CALL_RESULT","toolCallId":"call_00_NZ24ZchuyTEUXM937ORy3172","messageId":"029f6b18-0286-4b63-aeb7-28e39025e741","content":"{\"ok\":true,\"result\":{\"status\":\"available\",\"referenceOnly\":true,\"creatorVersion\":\"0.0.1\",\"versions\":{\"@za38.03/agent-ui-core\":\"0.0.1\",\"@za38.03/agent-ui-renderer\":\"0.0.1\",\"@za38.03/agent-ui-runtime\":\"0.0.1\",\"@za38.03/agent-ui-plugins\":\"0.0.1\",\"@za38.03/agent-ui-web-component\":\"0.0.1\",\"@za38.03/agent-ui-creator\":\"0.0.1\"},\"sourceDigest\":\"36c363e12ba6996246332ad2d3bbc5bbfdac9b49524ff624ed4a3387b850a575\",\"documentId\":\"internal:architecture/plugin-authoring-contract\",\"title\":\"`defaultPlacement`\",\"source\":\"internal\",\"topic\":\"插件开发与组合\",\"path\":\"references/docs/architecture/plugin-authoring-contract.md\",\"summary\":\"自定义插件 authoring、默认放置、容器子插槽、renderer、样式隔离和校验合同。\",\"sha256\":\"e09945ea7269cd43caabbf18eb2a96fce0f127db8abd03a001cde12119c91e22\",\"sectionId\":\"s68\",\"offset\":0,\"totalCharacters\":906,\"content\":\"### `defaultPlacement`\\n\\n`defaultPlacement` is the canonical placement used by Creator Add/Restore. It\\nis not a suggestion. When it is present and valid, the Host may promise a\\ndeterministic placement.\\n\\nFor a relative placement, the anchor Plugin must exist and be unique. The\\nrecommended dimension must match the relation axis:\\n\\n```text\\nbefore / after  -> recommendedSize.width\\nabove / below   -> recommendedSize.height\\n```\\n\\nMissing required axis sizing makes deterministic Creator Add/Restore\\nunavailable. The Analyzer reports this as a non-blocking readiness warning so\\nthe Plugin can remain limited without making `verify:ui` fail.\\n\\nFor a `plugin_slot` placement, the parent Plugin and child Slot must exist and\\nbe unique. The Slot's accepted capability must match the child Plugin's\\ncapabilities. A scoped renderer must target a `mode: \\\"renderer\\\"` Slot, and a\\nnon-renderer Plugin must not target one.\\n\\n\",\"nextOffset\":null}}","role":"tool"}

